message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Kinevo"
abstract: >-
  Kinevo is a personal operating system for planning, scheduling,
  execution, knowledge capture, progress tracking, and optional local AI
  assistance. It is a single-user, self-hostable, offline-capable,
  deterministic-core modular monolith built on Laravel, Vue 3, and PostgreSQL.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
keywords:
  - productivity
  - scheduling
  - personal-operating-system
  - offline-first
  - laravel
  - vue
  - postgresql